  "bio": "Remi Tattoo is a highly skilled tattoo artist, specializing in the unique styles of black & gray, trashpolka, and realism. Located in Kaunas, Lithuania, they are not only the esteemed owner of Remi Tattoo Gallery, but also boasts a massive following of around 86,000 tattoo enthusiasts on Instagram. Their intricate and artistic designs have helped solidify Remi as one of the leading figures in the tattoo industry.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location: Kaunas, Kauno Apskritis, Lithuania\n\n▪️Owner of @remistattoogallery\n▪️🇮🇪Dublin 🇱🇹 Kaunas\n▪️For bookings\n📩 remistattoo@gmail.com\n@remistattoogallery\n@aftercareh2ocean\n@radiantcolorscrew",
